<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Leslie Sept qtr profit dips.</title>
<headline>Leslie Sept qtr profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib profit		   2.42 vs 2.68</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 2.95 vs 1.00</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 117,000 vs 114,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		  638 vs 616.0</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		    5.5 vs 5.4</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		 47,135 vs 48,274</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    54,899 vs 52,497</p>
<p>Full name: Leslie Gold Mines Ltd, owned by Gencor Ltd.</p>
